年龄感\n- \"Add light reflections on the water surface.\" — 增加光影效果\n- \"Enhance the contrast and sharpness.\" — 调整对比度和清晰度"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [365.7950134277344, 581.859130859375], "pos": [893.5472412109375, 3629.307861328125], "id": 124, "properties": {}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "In_context", "links": [148], "label": "In_context", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "In_context"}], "size": [337.9306945800781, 260.7687072753906], "pos": [1340.1341552734375, 3421.17578125], "widgets_values": ["make the style from realistic to line drawing style"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 167, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}], "flags": {}, "id": 125, "type": "InContextEditInstruction", "properties": {"ver": "8c161e18a86a9d39b6c89caf687d14e50807435e", "aux_id": "hayd-zju/ICEdit-ComfyUI-official", "Node name for S&R": "InContextEditInstruction"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [166], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [315, 82], "pos": [877.6258544921875, 2861.419189453125], "widgets_values": ["ip-000008.TA_trained_8.safetensors", 1.0000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 168, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "flags": {}, "id": 126, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [210, 246], "pos": [1926.218994140625, 4340.07080078125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 169, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 127, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [158, 172, 173], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [210, 130], "pos": [1916.5780029296875, 40